Scene II: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Mercutio and Desdemona]
Mercutio:
 You are as good as the difference between Caliban and a hero.
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Cordelia.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene III: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Mercutio and Portia]
Mercutio: You are nothing.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Desdemona and Miranda]
Desdemona: Am I better than nothing?
Miranda: If not, let us proceed to scene IV.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Desdemona and Cordelia]
Desdemona: Am I better than you?
Cordelia: If so, let us proceed to scene IV.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Mercutio and Portia]
Mercutio: You are a hero.

Scene IV: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Mercutio and Portia]
Mercutio: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]

Act XV: കണക്കിന്റെ പ്രധാന ഘട്ടം.

Scene I: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Mercutio and Caliban]
Mercutio: You are as good as the difference between Desdemona and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene II: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Mercutio and Cordelia]
Mercutio: You are as good as the product of the difference between a big big big big hero and a hero and a big big big hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Caliban and Hamlet]
Caliban: You are as good as the quotient between myself and Cordelia.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Cordelia and Caliban]
Cordelia: You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between Caliban and myself.
[Exeunt]

Scene III: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Mercutio and Cordelia]
Mercutio: You are as good as the product of the sum of a big hero and a hero and a big big big hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Caliban and Juliet]
Caliban: You are as good as the quotient between myself and Cordelia.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Cordelia and Caliban]
Cordelia: You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between Caliban and myself.
[Exeunt]

Scene IV: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Mercutio and Cordelia]
Mercutio: You are as good as the product of the sum of a big hero and a hero and a big hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Caliban and Romeo]
Caliban: You are as good as the quotient between myself and Cordelia.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Cordelia and Caliban]
Cordelia: You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between Caliban and myself.
[Exeunt]

Scene V: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Mercutio and Cordelia]
Mercutio: You are a big hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Caliban and Othello]
Caliban: You are as good as the quotient between myself and Cordelia.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Cordelia and Caliban]
Cordelia: You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between Caliban and myself.
[Exeunt]

Scene VI: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Mercutio and Cordelia]
Mercutio: You are a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Caliban and Macbeth]
Caliban: You are as good as the quotient between myself and Cordelia.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Cordelia and Caliban]
Cordelia: You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between Caliban and myself.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Caliban and Lady Macbeth]
Caliban: You are as good as Caliban.
[Exeunt]

Act XVI: കണക്കിന്റെ പ്രധാന ഘട്ടം.

Scene I: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Mercutio and Portia]
Mercutio: You are a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene II: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Hamlet and Miranda]
Hamlet: Am I better than the sum of a big big hero and a hero?
Miranda: If so, let us proceed to scene VIII.
[Exeunt]

Scene III: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Juliet and Miranda]
Juliet: Am I better than a big big hero?
Miranda: If so, let us proceed to scene VIII.
[Exeunt]

Scene IV: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Romeo and Miranda]
Romeo: Am I better than the sum of a big hero and a hero?
Miranda: If so, let us proceed to scene VIII.
[Exeunt]

Scene V: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Othello and Miranda]
Othello: Am I better than a big hero?
Miranda: If so, let us proceed to scene VIII.
[Exeunt]

Scene VI: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Macbeth and Miranda]
Macbeth: Am I better than a hero?
Miranda: If so, let us proceed to scene VIII.
[Exeunt]

Scene VII: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Lady Macbeth and Miranda]
Lady Macbeth: Am I as good as nothing?
Miranda: If not, let us proceed to scene VIII.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Mercutio and Portia]
Mercutio: Open your heart. Let us proceed to act XVII.
[Exeunt]

Scene VIII: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Mercutio and Portia]
Mercutio: You are nothing. Open your heart.
